WEBVTT

00:03:29.451 --> 00:03:31.196
Student: OK.
AD: That's it, yes.

00:03:31.220 --> 00:03:33.223
AD: Yes, but the inside of your foot.

00:03:33.247 --> 00:03:34.871
That's it, yes.

00:03:34.895 --> 00:03:36.664
Nice. How does that feel?

00:03:36.688 --> 00:03:38.847
Student: Perfect.
AD: Perfect, good.

00:03:38.871 --> 00:03:41.620
That's it, I'm going to put
my hand on your back --

00:03:41.644 --> 00:03:42.795
There you go.

00:03:42.819 --> 00:03:46.017
I'm going to hold onto your leg,
then I'm going to put my hand here.

00:03:46.041 --> 00:03:48.234
Do you feel safe
to put your hand on the bar?

00:03:48.258 --> 00:03:49.409
I got you.

00:03:49.433 --> 00:03:50.589
How's that for you, OK?

00:03:51.106 --> 00:03:52.274
Student: Yeah?

00:03:52.298 --> 00:03:55.099
AD: Look, I can stop you going
forwards and backwards, see?

00:03:55.123 --> 00:03:56.456
Woo, I got you!

00:03:56.867 --> 00:03:58.763
(Voice-over) AD: This type of language,

00:03:58.787 --> 00:04:00.253
like "How are you feeling?